WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.968
-Guys, as I mentioned earlier,
the C.E.O.s of the biggest tech

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:05.004
companies in the country spoke
before Congress today

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.806
to defend
their business practices.

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:09.342
In case you missed it,
we put together a highlight reel

00:00:09.342 --> 00:00:11.744
of Facebook's Mark Zuckerberg
getting questioned.

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.178
Check it out.

00:00:13.178 --> 00:00:15.882
-Please state your name
and title to the committee.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:18.585
-I'm Mark Zuckerberg,
C.E.O. of Facebook,

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:21.921
a perfect website that has never
done anything wrong.

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:24.790
-Mr. Zuckerberg, how do you
respond to people who say

00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:27.060
your company has grown into
a monopoly?

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.562
-I don't see Facebook
as a monopoly.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:32.665
We want other social-media
platforms to succeed.

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.401
We just want their success to be
under the Facebook banner

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:38.270
and all the money they make
go to Facebook.

00:00:38.270 --> 00:00:40.740
-What are you doing to counter
fake news?

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.142
-Okay, obviously our company
needs to take

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:45.445
a more proactive role
with false information.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:49.048
That's why I'm excited to unveil
a new emoji people can use

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.950
when they think something
is not real.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:53.887 line:0%
We know these guys --
like, love --

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.723 line:0%
the faces humans make
when they feel emotions.

00:00:56.723 --> 00:00:59.492
But now we have
the "hmm" reaction.

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.762
If you see an article
that says DNA tests confirms

00:01:02.762 --> 00:01:04.497
Obama is a descendant
of Dracula,

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:06.499
you can click the hmm face,

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.000
and that will
let your friends know

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:09.636
"Hey, here is one person

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:13.172
who thinks this story
might not be up to snuff."

00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:17.877
-Uh, Mr. Zuckerberg,
I think you froze.

00:01:17.877 --> 00:01:20.313
-No.
This is just how my face is.

00:01:20.313 --> 00:01:23.883
-What do you have to say about
the Facebook advertiser boycott?

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.786
You lost a lot of huge sponsors
like Starbucks.

00:01:26.786 --> 00:01:28.488
-Forget Starbucks.

00:01:28.488 --> 00:01:30.056
I want to welcome
a more prestigious

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.725
caffeinated beverage company
to the Facebook family --

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:36.062 line:0%
Gush Force X100
Energy Discharge.

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.531 line:0%
Gush Force has
500% more caffeine

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:39.999 line:0%
than the FDA recommends.

00:01:39.999 --> 00:01:42.034 line:0%
It's been banned
in nine countries.

00:01:42.034 --> 00:01:43.903 line:0%
Facebook will be running
Gush Force ads

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:45.438 line:0%
until it's banned in
our country,

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.740 line:0%
and if they want to keep
paying us still after that.

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:54.414
Facebook is a public good.

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.415
It's the only place
where you can interact with

00:01:56.415 --> 00:01:58.718
elderly conspiracy theorists
who think the moon

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.653
is a big lizard egg
as well as bots from Senegal

00:02:01.653 --> 00:02:04.490
who try to sell you fraudulent
Buffalo Bills tickets.

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.859
You should be more concerned
about TikTok.

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.494
They're owned by China.

00:02:08.494 --> 00:02:10.830
TikTok collects personal info
without consent,

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.631
has been used to spread
fake news,

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:14.467
and is a national security
threat.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.102
If anyone is going to do
that stuff,

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:18.804
it should be an American
company, like Facebook.

00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:21.073
I'm going take all your concerns
to heart.

00:02:21.073 --> 00:02:23.676
Now, who should I write
the check out to?

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:26.478
-Mr. Zuckerberg, can you please
blink for us?

00:02:26.478 --> 00:02:28.547
You haven't blinked at all
this entire hearing,

00:02:28.547 --> 00:02:30.116
and it's very upsetting.

00:02:30.116 --> 00:02:31.284
-Sure.

